{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 244, "char_start": 0, "quote": "Input {\"capacity\": nonnegative int, \"ops\": list of [\"put\",key,value] or [\"get\",key] with integer keys/values}. Output the results of get commands; missing -> -1. Updating and successful get mark most recently used. Capacity zero stores nothing.", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 327, "char_start": 256, "quote": "Input:\n{\"capacity\": 0, \"ops\": [[\"put\", 1, 2], [\"get\", 1]]}\nOutput:\n[-1]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 440, "char_start": 339, "quote": "Input:\n{\"capacity\": 1, \"ops\": [[\"put\", 1, 4], [\"put\", 2, 5], [\"get\", 1], [\"get\", 2]]}\nOutput:\n[-1, 5]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R5", "source": {"char_end": 568, "char_start": 452, "quote": "Input:\n{\"capacity\": 2, \"ops\": [[\"put\", 1, 1], [\"put\", 2, 2], [\"get\", 1], [\"put\", 3, 3], [\"get\", 2]]}\nOutput:\n[1, -1]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 3: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R6", "source": {"char_end